# The screen reader (announce.c, fm1-reader): silent until a reader's HELLO; then the screen and its
# values, the song list's rows (a new composer first), the song loaded, play and pause, a page and
# its values, a knob's value as it turns (not the values the tune moves by itself), the remix's
# switches, messages, warnings, and the whole screen again on WHERE; nothing while ASID streams to a
# real chip (its timing first; the output's own message goes just before it starts), and again once paused
sid @SID1@ 2350
sid @SID2@ 1000
wait 4500
listen
wait 400
said SONGS. 2 SONGS
turn SELECT -1
wait 400
said Martin Galway. Wizball, 1 OF 2
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
said Rob Hubbard. Commando, 2 OF 2
tap PLAY
wait 4500
said PLAYER. Commando BY Rob Hubbard. SUBSONG 1 OF 19. PLAYING
tap PLAY
wait 300
said PAUSED
tap PLAY
wait 300
said PLAYING
tap ENV
wait 500
said PAGE ENV, VOICE 1. A
turn K1 2
wait 900
said A 2
press SAVE
tap REC
release SAVE
wait 300
said VOICE 1 MUTED. VOICE 3 MUTED.
press HOME
tap ENV
release HOME
wait 300
said VOICE 1 SAWTOOTH.
tap GLO
wait 500
said PAGE GLO. TEMPO 100%
turn K1 3
wait 900
said TEMPO
tap OCT-
tap OCT+
press OCT-
press OCT+
wait 200
release OCT-
release OCT+
wait 300
said REMIX RESET
tap LFO
wait 500
where
wait 400
said PLAYER. Commando BY Rob Hubbard. SUBSONG 1 OF 19. PLAYING
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said OUTPUT: ASID
tap ENV
wait 500
quiet
tap PLAY
wait 400
said PAUSED
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said OUTPUT: EMULATED SID
